{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-swimlane-diagram",
  "category": "diagrams",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-swimlane-diagram&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-swimlane-diagram",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": "Diagrama de actividad con carriles: cada fila es un responsable y cada columna un momento del proceso.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p>Responde lo que un flujo normal no responde: <strong>quién</strong> hace cada paso. La columna se declara o se deduce por orden topológico; un enlace hacia atrás se dibuja punteado y por debajo, como reproceso.</p>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-swimlane-diagram open-on-click>",
            "  <script type=\"application/json\">",
            "    {",
            "      \"swimlane\": {",
            "        \"title\": \"Publicación de instrucciones\",",
            "        \"lanes\": [",
            "          { \"id\": \"negocio\", \"name\": \"Área solicitante\", \"hue\": 210 },",
            "          { \"id\": \"ing\", \"name\": \"Ingeniería\", \"hue\": 160 },",
            "          { \"id\": \"bd\", \"name\": \"Base de datos\", \"hue\": 38 }",
            "        ],",
            "        \"steps\": [",
            "          { \"id\": \"pide\", \"lane\": \"negocio\", \"label\": \"Solicita ajuste\", \"kind\": \"start\" },",
            "          { \"id\": \"redacta\", \"lane\": \"ing\", \"label\": \"Redacta catálogo\" },",
            "          { \"id\": \"revisa\", \"lane\": \"negocio\", \"label\": \"¿Aprueba?\", \"kind\": \"decision\" },",
            "          { \"id\": \"merge\", \"lane\": \"bd\", \"label\": \"MERGE idempotente\" },",
            "          { \"id\": \"verifica\", \"lane\": \"ing\", \"label\": \"Verifica conteo\" },",
            "          { \"id\": \"cierra\", \"lane\": \"negocio\", \"label\": \"Cierra tiquete\", \"kind\": \"end\" }",
            "        ],",
            "        \"links\": [",
            "          { \"from\": \"pide\", \"to\": \"redacta\" },",
            "          { \"from\": \"redacta\", \"to\": \"revisa\" },",
            "          { \"from\": \"revisa\", \"to\": \"merge\", \"label\": \"sí\" },",
            "          { \"from\": \"revisa\", \"to\": \"redacta\", \"label\": \"ajustes\" },",
            "          { \"from\": \"merge\", \"to\": \"verifica\" },",
            "          { \"from\": \"verifica\", \"to\": \"cierra\" }",
            "        ]",
            "      }",
            "    }",
            "  </script>",
            "</iswc-swimlane-diagram>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:open-on-click",
              "label": "open-on-click"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "app-api",
      "title": "App API",
      "lede": "El mismo documento se abre en el visor o en el editor. El parámetro json no se reescribe al modificar el diagrama.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<p><a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/view.html?kind=swimlane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir visor</a> · <a href=\"demos/diagramas/app/edit.html?kind=swimlane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Abrir editor</a></p>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
